  "body": "Positioned within the sought-after Ara Hills community, 35 Kikorangi Drive is a home where thoughtful design, quality craftsmanship and exceptional attention to detail come together to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nProperty features.\r\n* Sought-after Ara Hills location\r\n* Elevated sea views with exceptional privacy\r\n* Expansive windows capturing natural light from three sides\r\n* Impressive high-stud upper-level living\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to generous Garapa decking\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n* Integrated fridge, freezer and dishwasher\r\n* Zephyr instant hot and cold water tap\r\n* Spacious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Two additional bedrooms plus a second living area\r\n* Beautifully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n* Five-zone air conditioning, controllable via smartphone and wall panel\r\n* Private swimming pool with year-round temperature control\r\n* Additional covered outdoor entertaining area and outdoor shower\r\n* Automatic entrance gates and security system\r\n* Beautifully landscaped grounds\r\n* Queenstown schist stone entrance and sleeper garden beds\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the attention to detail is evident. A grand entrance, automatic gates, beautifully landscaped gardens and striking Queenstown schist stone create a memorable first impression.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, expansive windows capture natural light from three sides, while the impressive high-stud ceiling enhances the sense of space rarely found on an upper level. The open-plan living flows effortlessly onto a generous Garapa deck, where beautiful sea views can be enjoyed in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is finished with premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, an integrated fridge, freezer and dishwasher, alongside a Zephyr instant hot and cold water tap.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master suite features blackout shutters, a generous walk-in wardrobe with LED lighting and a beautifully tiled ensuite with underfloor heating.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, two additional bedrooms, a second bathroom and a separate living area provide excellent flexibility. Another deck extends the outdoor living, leading down to the private pool and a covered entertaining area with an outdoor shower and scope to create something special.\r\n\r\nThe grounds are equally impressive, with strategic planting, sleeper-edged garden beds, tall fescue lawns and carefully considered landscaping throughout.\r\n\r\nCompleting the home is a five-zone air conditioning system, independently controlled via smartphone or wall panel, alongside automatic gates and an alarm system for added convenience and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nThis is a home where the details aren't simply an afterthought. From the architectural proportions and natural light to the quality of the finishes and carefully designed outdoor spaces, everything has been brought together with purpose.\r\n\r\n35 Kikorangi Drive is a home that needs to be experienced to fully appreciate.\r\n\r\nWe welcome all agents for conjunctions.\r\n\r\nAuction at Professionals Albany, 1/5 Paul Matthews Road, Albany on Thursday 17th December 2026 at 1:30pm  (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nGet in touch to get more information or to book a private viewing.\r\n\r\nOpen home times are listed below, we look forward to meeting you!",
